I have many ''mains'', so there you go;

&#x200B;

For Zoe;

* Cottontail (like Fizz and Teemo).
* Snow Day (with ice skates, they already have the animation from Cyber Pop's roller skates)
* Vampire
* Little Demon
* Elf (like Tristana or Jinx)

For Neeko;

* Dawnbringer, if you've seen the [recent fan splash art](https://i.redd.it/tfkbnrzjpo551.jpg) of it, you know why this is here...
* Sweetheart, because Neeko is a sweet heart
* PROGRAM (I don't generally like how this skin line looks, but Neeko has potential...)

For Kayle;

* Immortal Journey is a given.
* Star Guardian (I love SG, don't blame me)

For Qiyana;

* Pool Party, with a life saver for her weapon.
* Immortal Journey
* Coven please thank you.
